OL,5,G0030 Through the Night
OL,6,     FLahav Shani conducts La Scala
OL,7,     FPhilharmonic Orchestra in
OL,8,     FMendelssohn's Violin Concerto in E
OL,9,     Fminor, joined by violinist Joshua
OL,10,     FBell. We then hear Dvorak's
OL,11,     Fintense Symphony No 9.
OL,12,G0630 Breakfast
OL,13,     FTom McKinney presents Radio 3's
OL,14,     FBreakfast show. To get in touch,
OL,15,     Femail 3breakfast@bbc.co.uk.
OL,16,G0930 Essential Classics
OL,17,     FGeorgia Mann plays the best in
OL,18,     Fclassical music for your morning,
OL,19,     Fwith discoveries and surprises
OL,20,     Frubbing shoulders with familiar
OL,21,     Ffavourites.
