OL,5,G1300 Classical Live
OL,6,     FElizabeth Alker brings you
OL,7,     Fexclusive live performances,
OL,8,     Fincluding Berlioz's Symphonie
OL,9,     Ffantastique from the Leipzig
OL,10,     FGewandhaus.
OL,11,G1600 Composer of the Week: Rameau
OL,12,     F2/5. Donald Macleod surveys
OL,13,     FRameau's new career as a composer
OL,14,     Ffor the stage, at a time when
OL,15,     FRameau had not long turned fifty
OL,16,     Fyears old.
OL,17,G1700 In Tune
OL,18,     FGuitarists Marta Pereira da Costa
OL,19,     Fand Joao Pita Junior. Chris Butler
OL,20,     Fand Erik Bosgraaf on the London
OL,21,     FInternational Festival of Early
OL,22,     FMusic.
